flowchart TD
  U[Customer message] --> LD[Language detection]
  LD --> CF{Control reply? YES, NO, OTP, consent}
  CF -- yes --> CTRL[Deterministic control flow - no LLM]
  CF -- no --> IC[Intent classifier and entity extraction]
  IC --> HR{Human requested or high risk?}
  HR -- yes --> HO[Warm handover]
  HR -- no --> RT[Route]
  RT --> CC[CustomerCareAgent]
  RT --> BL[BillingAgent]
  RT --> SL[SalesAgent]
  RT --> NW[NetworkAgent]
  RT --> SD[SimDeviceAgent]
  RT --> OR[OrderAgent]
  RT --> RN[RetentionAgent]
  RT --> KN[KnowledgeAgent]
  CC --> TG[ToolGateway]
  BL --> TG
  SL --> TG
  NW --> TG
  SD --> TG
  OR --> TG
  RN --> TG
  KN --> RAG[(Knowledge base)]
  TG --> SY[Synthesis: messages from tool results]
  RAG --> SY
  SY --> GR{Guardrails pass?}
  GR -- yes --> OUT[Reply with sources and references]
  GR -- no --> HO
